<title>PHILIPPINES: Sime Darby sets 10 centavos cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Sime Darby sets 10 centavos cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sime Darby Pilipinas Inc, a unit of Malaysia's Sime Darby Bhd, on Thursday declared a 10 centavo per share cash dividend for the second quarter of its 1996/97 fiscal year ending June.  </p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on March 19 to all stockholders on record as of February 17, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sime Darby's interests include rubber plantations, manufacturing and property development.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
